  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Peace and Development in Mindanao</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Action intends to contribute to the MIP 2021-27 Priority Area 2- Peaceful and Just Society, Good Governance and in particular the following Specific Objective: SO 4: Peace gains in Mindanao are consolidated and the humanitarian-peace and development triple nexus is strengthened in EU interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
